    "body": "You need to use a bash-compatible shell in order to run the installation script. Sadly, ZSH is not 100% bash-compatible, nor is there a way to get it to run in that way.\r\n\r\nReplace the `zsh` in the command with `bash` and things should start working.\r\n\r\nEDIT: earlier version of this comment said \"POSIX compatible\" instead of bash, because I was having a brain fart.",
